   "installerTest": "Press and hold Menu and Down for 3 seconds to enter the Advanced menu. Press Down until TEST is displayed, press Select. Use Up/Down to toggle through the test types Heat, Cool, Fan, EM Heat and Ver (thermostat version information), then press Select. Press Up to turn stages on one at a time and Down to turn them off. Press Home to exit the System Test. Stage codes shown on screen: Heat 0 = All Off, 1 = Heat Stage 1 on, 2 = Heat Stage 2 also on (TH6320U/TH6220U only), 3 = Heat Stage 3 also on (TH6320U only). Cool 0 = All Off, 1 = Cool Stage 1 on, 2 = Cool Stage 2 also on (TH6320U/TH6220U only). Fan 0 = Fan Off, 1 = Fan On. EM Heat 0 = All Off, 1 = EM Heat on. Source: docs.honeywellhome.com T6 Pro Installation Manual, 8. System Test.",
