   "3-wire SPDT heat-only zone valve wiring uses terminal 6 (closes valve, marked (6) in the figure), W (opens valve, marked (4)), G (blower/circulator), RH (24V hot heat, marked (5)), RC and C.",
   "Comfort Alert II module (or similar system diagnostic module) wires to L, and requires a common connection for diagnostic/malfunction indication.",
   "Electrical rating: mV to 30 VAC NEC Class II 50/60 Hz or DC; hardwire input 20 to 30 VAC; 1.5 A per terminal, 2.5 A maximum all terminals combined."
