  "stages": "Up to 2 stages heat / 2 stages cool. Configurable as SS 1 (single stage), MS 2 (multi-stage, no heat pump) or HP 1 (heat pump with one compressor stage). Applications: heat pump with or without aux/emergency heat, heat only (with optional fan switch), milli...",
