   "factoryReset": "Hard reset for a blank/erratic display: remove the wires from terminals R and C (do NOT short them together) and remove the batteries for 2 minutes, then replace wires and batteries. To reset the programming, clock and configuration settings to factory defaults, press Up and Down and the FAN (VENT) button simultaneously - the display goes blank and then all segments display momentarily. A reset returns the installer/configuration menu and programming to factory settings."
