     "Check breaker/system switch is fully ON",
     "Confirm compatibility before wiring",
     "Re-strip wire to 3/8 in, clean, straight, reseat fully",
     "Temporarily power via USB-C while diagnosing",
     "Check for a blown fuse on the HVAC control board",
     "Reinstall old thermostat to isolate Nest vs system fault"
