   "Daikin One Lite is for ductless (mini/multi-split) indoor units only, connected through an S21 Translation Adaptor, not directly to a conventional or unitary board.",
   "Indoor units with a native S21 interface (e.g. many FTXS/CTXS/FTX models) connect directly; indoor units without native S21 need a separate interface adaptor: KER087A41 (for FTXM09-24WVJU, CTXV07AVJU9, FTX/FTK09-12NMVJU, FTXQ09-12ASBU9, FTXV09-24AVJU9, FTKF/FTXF09-24BVJU9), KRP067A41E or KRP980B2E (for FTX15-24NMVJU, FTK18-24NMVJU).",
   "NOT compatible with handheld IR remote controllers BRC944 or KRP928.",
   "Max wire distance between the thermostat and the S21 translation adaptor is 125 ft using field-supplied 18 AWG, 4-conductor, solid, non-shielded wire; the translation adaptor itself must be within about 5.5 ft of the indoor unit's S21 harness.",
   "Never mount the translation adaptor by screwing into the indoor unit itself; it mounts to a wall/chase using its own screws, with two cable channels so the S21 cable and thermostat cable exit the same side.",
   "Aux output is a single dry contact (Aux/Aux C) - a 24VAC+ signal must be routed through a field-supplied SPST relay; aux heat only works with heat pump systems.",
