   "access": "On first power-up, choose Unitary/S21/P1P2, then 'Begin Setup' walks a 5-step wizard (1 Communication, 2 Personalization, 3 Equipment Setup, 4 System Optimization, 5 Preferences); steps can be revisited later via the thermostat's 'Dealer Edit' entry point. To re-enter Dealer Edit: acknowledge the continue prompt, tap the info icon (top right) to reveal a one-time installer code, close that screen, then enter the code on the Dealer Edit lock screen and press 'unlock thermostat'.",
