   "All ABCD bus rules are unchanged from the 12SI document: 4-wire minimum but pull extra conductors, consistent color convention throughout, 18 AWG over 25 ft, shielded twisted pair with the shield landed at the indoor unit only, daisy chain preferred, 100 ohm terminators on runs over 100 ft."
