   "installerTest": "Press and hold the FAN button for 20 seconds (15 seconds enters installer setup - keep holding to 20). 'InS' appears and the SERVICE icon lights. MODE changes the operating mode; AUTO is not available and heating and cooling must be tested independently. HEAT: stage 1 for 3 minutes (180 sec), then stages 1 and 2 for another 3 minutes - the test always tries to run a second-stage output whether or not one exists, giving a minimum of 6 minutes of stage-1 operation, then MODE returns to OFF. COOL: same 3 + 3 minute sequence. EHEAT: auxiliary heat for 3 minutes then MODE returns to OFF. Pressing FAN while no heating/cooling is running energizes the FAN relay and displays the FAN icon. Test ends after 15 minutes of inactivity, or immediately by pressing RESET FILTER.",
